{"2538870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "False Hero", "steam_appid": 2538870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4709240], "detailed_description": "<h1>Note from the author</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>False Hero is a solo dev game, retro-styled, fast-paced soulslike adventure with a unique combat system. The game focuses on challenging fights, skill mastery, and atmosphere rather than gear management, leveling, or grinding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a lifelong fan of Souls-like and adventure games, I tried to create my own take, looking more into the genre's old-school roots. Everything, from the art and code to the music, has been handcrafted by me with care and attention to detail. No AI was used in the development process.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Over 6 years of development, I've poured my heart and soul into this game, and I truly hope you'll enjoy it!</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm where the gods of life reign, Death starts to spread. It is foretold that you, a husk of a once-diligent scholar, will find a legendary mask and slay this eldritch evil. In the mountaintop kingdom of Wisdom, a prophecy begins to unfold, but it is your decision to fight for the gods and fulfill the prophecy or to become an apostle of Death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade enemy attacks, chain together your learned combat arts into unique combos, and channel the power of gods to crush your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/51c7ce118e7085e024c5e8cbc10f7991.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/51c7ce118e7085e024c5e8cbc10f7991.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/51c7ce118e7085e024c5e8cbc10f7991.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Copy your enemies' attacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mask grants you the ability to steal your enemies' combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn unique attacks from each enemy you kill, and grow your arsenal of dozens of deadly combat arts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c469ca36bb457ef5effbef486e8ac0e1.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c469ca36bb457ef5effbef486e8ac0e1.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c469ca36bb457ef5effbef486e8ac0e1.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging boss fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss fights will truly put your fighting skills to the test. From giant arachnoids and mechanical beasts to dragons and terrifying angelic beings, every single boss is designed with their unique move set to be challenging but fair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c4c75e6ef4dc57a200f060dc7913c028.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c4c75e6ef4dc57a200f060dc7913c028.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c4c75e6ef4dc57a200f060dc7913c028.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will travel through lush swamps, chilling ruins, and ancient cities. Each world features unique enemies and secrets. Explore the twisted lands of the gods and uncover the truth behind the spreading of Death in this once thriving world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/8377eb55124d4723806842f579c10b85.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/8377eb55124d4723806842f579c10b85.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/8377eb55124d4723806842f579c10b85.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal your enemies' attacks and weave their moves into your own combos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique and challenging monsters and terrifying bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large, interconnected surreal worlds and uncover their secrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the god's powers to solve puzzles and gain an edge in combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the fate of this world: rescue the gods of Life or become an apostle of Death </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All lands have fallen to Death and been corrupted beyond repair. Let them live on or destroy them once and for all!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm where the gods of life reign, Death starts to spread. It is foretold that you, a husk of a once-diligent scholar, will find a legendary mask and slay this eldritch evil. In the mountaintop kingdom of Wisdom, a prophecy begins to unfold, but it is your decision to fight for the gods and fulfill the prophecy or to become an apostle of Death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade enemy attacks, chain together your learned combat arts into unique combos, and channel the power of gods to crush your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/51c7ce118e7085e024c5e8cbc10f7991.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/51c7ce118e7085e024c5e8cbc10f7991.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/51c7ce118e7085e024c5e8cbc10f7991.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Copy your enemies' attacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mask grants you the ability to steal your enemies' combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn unique attacks from each enemy you kill, and grow your arsenal of dozens of deadly combat arts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c469ca36bb457ef5effbef486e8ac0e1.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c469ca36bb457ef5effbef486e8ac0e1.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c469ca36bb457ef5effbef486e8ac0e1.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging boss fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss fights will truly put your fighting skills to the test. From giant arachnoids and mechanical beasts to dragons and terrifying angelic beings, every single boss is designed with their unique move set to be challenging but fair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c4c75e6ef4dc57a200f060dc7913c028.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c4c75e6ef4dc57a200f060dc7913c028.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/c4c75e6ef4dc57a200f060dc7913c028.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will travel through lush swamps, chilling ruins, and ancient cities. Each world features unique enemies and secrets. Explore the twisted lands of the gods and uncover the truth behind the spreading of Death in this once thriving world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/8377eb55124d4723806842f579c10b85.poster.avif?t=1788136371\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/8377eb55124d4723806842f579c10b85.webm?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/8377eb55124d4723806842f579c10b85.mp4?t=1788136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal your enemies' attacks and weave their moves into your own combos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique and challenging monsters and terrifying bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large, interconnected surreal worlds and uncover their secrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the god's powers to solve puzzles and gain an edge in combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the fate of this world: rescue the gods of Life or become an apostle of Death </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All lands have fallen to Death and been corrupted beyond repair. Let them live on or destroy them once and for all!</strong></p>", "short_description": "False Hero is a fast-paced soulslike adventure where you steal your enemies’ attacks and chain them into deadly combos. Explore the corrupted Land of the Gods and put your combat skills to the true test in challenging boss fights. Will you fight for the Gods or become an apostle of Death?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This dev has such a strong grasp on what makes a Souls-like tick. The power stealing mechanic is so neat. I think what's cool about this one is how you'll have multiple equipped at once, and part of the fun and part of the skill expression is in figuring out the best way to combo them together in different situations.”<br>Iron Pineapple<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/e4937260e4d9e0e9295384e0abc0ecf79df538c3/header.jpg?t=1788136371", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/5fffba9781e0dcb44d2c5bc3fb788dacf0c7961f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788136371", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/5fffba9781e0dcb44d2c5bc3fb788dacf0c7961f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788136371", "website": "https://torchlight-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 1060 6GB or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Torchlight Games"], "publishers": ["Ytopia"], "demos": [{"appid": 4702340, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id":